# Commits that may change desktop/ or shared-ui/ inside a Wagonwheel pull request.
# One entry per line: <patch-id> # why.   Find a patch-id with:
#   git diff-tree -p --no-renames --root <sha> | git patch-id --stable
# A patch-id survives a rebase. Keep this list at ONE entry. Do not add to it to get a
# check to pass: move the change to its own pull request instead.
