# Decided by the owner (Option 1): keep shared-ui/. It moved generic primitives out of
# desktop/ so Wagonwheel can reuse them, and it was checked: tsc, eslint, 70 tests, and
# the built Nucleus CSS is byte-identical. DELETE THIS ENTRY once that commit is on main.
